{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2675917,"ns":0,"title":"Extremal combinatorics","extract":"Extremal combinatorics is a field of combinatorics, which is itself a part of mathematics. Extremal combinatorics studies how large or how small a collection of finite objects (numbers, graphs, vectors, sets, etc.) can be, if it has to satisfy certain restrictions.","description":"Area of combinatorics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}